  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Support to European Institue (EIP) Somalia 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till European Institute of Peace (EIP) Somalia 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att via European Institute for Peace (EIP) st&#xf6;dja Somalias federala regering med att skapa l&#xe5;ngsiktig stabilitet i norra Somalia genom direkt samarbete med lokala akt&#xf6;rer och genom fr&#xe4;mjandet av konstruktiva dialoginsatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at via the European Institute for Peace (EIP) support the Federal Government of Somalia (FGS) in securing long-term stability of northern Somalia through direct collaboration with local partners and promotion constructive dialogue efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
